sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Developer app
    participant AM as Account Manager
    participant Issuer as Certificate issuer
    App->>AM: HTTPS POST /v1/auth/login (email, password)
    AM-->>App: user.id, tokens, app_certificate.status
    alt csr_required
        Note over App: Generate local key and CSR for app-user:user_id
        App->>AM: HTTPS POST /v1/auth/login (app_csr_pem)
        alt CSR subject and authorization valid
            AM->>Issuer: mTLS POST /v1/certificates/app/issue
            Issuer-->>AM: Certificate and issuance metadata
            AM-->>App: issued certificate-only bundle
            Note over App: Match certificate to retained private key
        else CSR invalid or issuer unavailable
            AM-->>App: HTTP error with bootstrap failure code
        end
    else issued
        Note over App: Reuse matching retained key, do not rotate on routine login
    end
